{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11112090","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11112090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1111209001:2":{"text":"あたしだって子どもをいじめたいわけじゃないけど、アンダンドラは何がなんでも連れ出すって決めたんだから！","source_cn":"我可不想欺负小孩！总之，我一定要带安丹德拉离开，这是我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD863A1ADCABAB69C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111209002:1":{"text":"サテラ、この子たちには私が必要なんだ。分かるだろ？","source_cn":"萨忒娜，这些孩子非常需要我，你能理解才对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB67AA82B5BBC1FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111209003:2":{"text":"あたしだって君が必要だった！でも君はあたしを置いてったじゃない……そんなのずるいよ！","source_cn":"我也很需要你！可当年你还不是抛下我一走了之？你太偏心了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AB5FE23AF910367","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111209004:1":{"text":"あの時は、他に選択肢がなかったんだ……","source_cn":"我那时没有别的选择……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB465CFDDB75D297","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111209005:1":{"text":"あんたは昔から頭がよくて勇敢ないい子だから、きっと大丈夫だって信じてたんだよ。","source_cn":"我知道你会照顾好自己。你是个聪明又勇敢的好孩子，一直都是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2AE495B3384B27F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111209006:2":{"text":"そんな言葉で許すと思ったら大間違いだからね！あたしは、君の自分を大事にしないところがむかつくのよ！","source_cn":"别以为说了这些好听的我就会原谅你！你不顾自身安危的样子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F5D8F179B820A2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111209007:1":{"text":"自分のことも考えてるさ、でも子どもたちが傷つくのは見たくないんだ。","source_cn":"我在乎自己的安全，但我不能看着孩子们受伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B60EB06849F4C76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111209008:1":{"text":"ここには強盗だけでなく、クリムゾン高原から暴走した動物たちがやって来ることもあるからな。","source_cn":"这里不仅有匪徒窥伺，还有许多发了疯的动物们从深红高原那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2C5700DF4054AAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111209009:1":{"text":"クリムゾン高原？うーん……やはりおかしいですね。","source_cn":"深红高原？嗯……果然有问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF6B23B0768DF643","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111209010:1":{"text":"何か知っているのか？","source_cn":"你们知道什么吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD89DD99B161793C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choic